{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Do not hide JVM-fatal cleanup failures.** This `handle` discards the handler completion error, so if suspension/retry wins and scope cleanup then throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, the invocation incorrectly returns PENDING/RETRYING. Inspect and unwrap the handler failure after the bounded wait, rethrow fatal errors, and preserve the durable control-flow outcome only for ordinary cleanup failures. Add suspension and retry regression tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74o8Lz","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":225,"observation_digest":"6fcdab3dca509c03f89e7435723c14b23fd11000868c197aa442a9fd574c07e8","observation_id":"aro_v1_n7g2wpokkcoah6e6oq2xepauwi","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T03:13:29Z","review_id":"arr_v1_535xlid3vgtfbr4dah35k6itzj","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"95ed86d294b31a1fc987850928cc35e507d1a900","reviewer":"codex","start_line":225,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_enlcgqvz67vlo6h7ldrkctpv65","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T03:13:29Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
